      ":question/problem": "Let\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhat are the dimensions of $BA?$",
